                                "text": "Never trust in the partly unscrupulous and partly dysfunctional state apparatus.",
                                "translation": "永远不要相信那些部分不道德、部分功能失调的国家机器。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8eb7c4bd-1c9e-4aa3-981f-f2957f1c5327",
                                "sense_id": "ee2e6524-4249-35e7-b9e2-f94f0234da3e",
                                "text": "A former chief of staff of the Israel Defence Forces said that Netanyahu should “resign now”, while a former intelligence official described the government as “dysfunctional”."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5a7412e4-f46b-4dba-810f-8ecf7b0472cd",
                                "sense_id": "ee2e6524-4249-35e7-b9e2-f94f0234da3e",
                                "text": "It is difficult to find the right words for what has happened in the five years since the May 2018 timetable changes exposed the very dysfunctional nature of the franchise system set up by the privatisation process of the 1990s."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
